			<item>
				<title>No Wobble, No Sag: Ergotron HX With a 49-Inch Ultrawide</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/ergotron-hx/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/ergotron-hx/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Built for large, heavy panels where lighter arms droop or bounce.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Constant-Force lift moves a big display with one finger and holds position.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Internal cable channels keep the desk clean.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Solid clamp that bites properly on a thick hardwood desk.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Ergotron&amp;#43;HX&amp;#43;Desk&amp;#43;Monitor&amp;#43;Arm&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Ergotron HX Heavy-Duty Monitor Arm&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;most-arms-cant-hold-a-real-ultrawide&#34;&gt;Most arms can&amp;rsquo;t hold a real ultrawide&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A 49-inch curved panel is heavy and has a lot of leverage. Put it on a mid-range arm and you get sag, a slow droop over the day, and a bounce every time you type hard. The HX is engineered for exactly this weight class. Before you buy the monitor, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Ergotron&amp;#43;HX&amp;#43;Desk&amp;#43;Monitor&amp;#43;Arm&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Ergotron HX Heavy-Duty Monitor Arm&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;price the arm on Amazon&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
